amid": "76561198087665316", "personaname": "Zora", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/OniIchigo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 28003, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6156, "last_played": 1786479399, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "So when I got this originally I didn't expect to enjoy the game as much as I have.  There is a lot of love from the developers in this game.  It's easy to tell from playing it.  There is a season pass that you can get stuff from, but it's a free pass, and the fact that you don't need to worry about missing out on stuff from the pass when it goes away as items from the pass get moved to other item pools like cargo crates, lost packs, and the in-game shop which doesn't take real life currency.  It's very fun to play with friends especially if each goes as a different dwarf class.  It's even easy to play on older computers that also don't got a lot of memory.  Definitely give this game a try.  It's really fun to play and really satisfying to kill the bugs and mine the ores.", "timestamp_created": 1705360778, "timestamp_updated": 1705360778, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156065107", "author": {"steamid": "76561199261329946", "personaname": "CosmicJakc043", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199261329946/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 18669, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6708, "last_played": 1778619202, "avatar": "02824a7f6e98b080c3dafb134741aa49609895c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am a dwarf and I'm digg